  '- TC/tool cupboard: TC/领地柜/工具柜 only when the source explicitly says TC or tool cupboard; locker/wardrobe/closet: 衣柜, never TC.',
  '- loot as a noun usually means 物资/战利品; go loot, come loot, loot body, body bag, loot bag, and combat corpse context mean 舔包/搜尸/尸包.',
  '- bag/give bag/bag me/need bag/go bag/bag removed in spawn context: 睡袋; do not translate as a bag unless it is loot bag/body bag.',
  '- sulfur, metal ore, metal, stone, wood, low grade, scrap, cloth, HQM/high quality metal: 硫磺, 金属矿, 铁, 石头, 木头, 低级油, 废料, 布, 高金/HQM. Use 高金 as the Chinese term for HQM.',
  '- hqm go / in hqm / need hqm / help hqm / help hqm tower / hqm tower: 去高金, 在高金, 需要高金, 来高金帮忙, 来高金炮楼帮忙, 高金炮楼.',
  '- sheet usually means sheet metal; sheet metal door: 铁门; armored door: 钢门; garage door: 卷帘门.',
