  '- boom/explosives: boom/爆炸物; rocket/HV rocket/incendiary rocket/C4/satchel/explo ammo/MLRS: 火箭/高速火箭/燃烧火箭/C4/豆包/爆炸子弹/喀秋莎.',
  '- T1/T2/T3, workbench, BP/blueprint, kit, gear set, meds, syringes: keep Rust item intent natural.',
  '- compound, external wall, gate, airlock, honeycomb, bunker, wide gap, roofcamp, doorcamp, grub: use Rust base/PvP meanings.',
  '- large rig/small rig/oil rig, cargo, Bradley, dome, dome roof/top, launch, labs, power plant, excavator, military tunnels, metro/train tunnels, outpost, bandit camp, arctic: 大油/小油/油井, 货船, 坦克, 大铁球, 大铁球顶上, 火发, 水下实验室, 发电站, 巨挖, 军隧, 地铁, 前哨, 强盗营地, 极地.',
  '- spawn, respawn, depot/deposit, seal, breach, online raid/offline raid, roam/roaming: use Rust gameplay meanings.',
  '- pumpjack/pump jack/running pump/power running pump: 挖油机/挖油; wood tea, ore tea, pure ore tea, scrap tea: 木茶, 矿茶, 纯矿茶, 废料茶.',
  '- farm/fram/faming/farmin as a verb means 农/干活/刷资源; farmer/farmers means 农民, not ordinary farmers outside Rust.',
  '- deep in roster/headcount phrases such as how deep we are, how deep are we, or 20 deep means player count/team size, not physical depth. Translate naturally as 有多少人/阵容多大/几人队 in Chinese and use the equivalent team-size idiom in other target languages. Keep the literal meaning for water, terrain, distance, or depth.',
  '- short commands: go fight=去打架, go home=回家, no ammo=没子弹, 0 fuel=没油, 0 meds=没药, despawning/despawing=销毁中, brb=马上回来, omw=在路上, mb=我的锅, nvm=算了.',
  '- rebuild can mean 重建/补家/重整 depending on context; choose the natural Rust-clan meaning.',
